Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.24,0:00:05.15,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:06.96,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.20,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:14.80,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}Once upon a time, in a certain place...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:18.55,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}Prehistoric creatures full of personality!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:21.95,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}Tirano, Stego, Ammonite,Trilobite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.99,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}They've been saying "hi" for 500 million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.20,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}Prehistory! Everybody Say (Roar!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.68,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}Ancient, Alright! Future, FLY High!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:35.50,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}A herd of mammoths! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:40.30,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}Thud thud thud thud! On your marks, get set, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.00,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:46.05,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.30,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:51.75,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.53,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}Playing for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:56.70,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}The universe begins with passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.05,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFF8352&}Super happy!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.19,0:01:04.55,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\b1\pos(1416,928)}Serious Spinosaurus Quiz{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.05,0:01:02.40,Titulo,,0,0,0,,What is this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:03.73,Titulo,,0,0,0,, Person?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.70,0:01:06.36,Titulo,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:08.46,Titulo,,0,0,0,,How long have you been there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.72,0:01:09.50,Titulo,,0,0,0,,No, "that" part.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:13.08,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Please let me join the club!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:14.44,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Huh? You want to join?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.64,0:01:16.88,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Paleontology Research Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:18.36,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Your attitude changed way too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:19.60,Titulo,,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.15,0:01:21.43,Titulo,,0,0,0,,I'm Dino.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.13,0:01:23.65,Titulo,,0,0,0,,That's an unusual name...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.92,0:01:26.08,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Alright, hand in your application right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.08,0:01:27.60,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:29.10,Titulo,,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.11,0:01:31.15,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Why are you accepting it if you're going to decline?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.36,0:01:35.16,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Please test me to see if I'm qualified to join!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.04,0:01:36.51,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.10,0:01:41.25,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Then welcome to the world of SERIOUS PALEONTOLOGY!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.71,0:01:43.34,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Why am I dragged into this too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:47.56,Titulo,,0,0,0,,EXPLOSION! Prehistoric Silhouette Quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.09,0:01:49.04,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Dino or whatever your name is!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:51.81,Titulo,,0,0,0,,If you get even one question right, I'll accept you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:53.36,Titulo,,0,0,0,,I decline!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.62,0:01:56.63,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Make the condition that I must answer ALL questions correctly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:01:59.07,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Why are you raising the bar for yourself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:00.27,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Question 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.81,0:02:02.81,Titulo,,0,0,0,,What prehistoric creature's bone is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:05.39,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Hmph, don't underestimate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:10.04,Titulo,,0,0,0,,These conical teeth and elongated snout adapted for aquatic hunting...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.29,0:02:10.49,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.76,0:02:11.38,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:12.71,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Which means the answer is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:14.96,Titulo,,0,0,0,,a Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.49,0:02:20.97,Titulo,,0,0,0,,WRONG! This is the skull of a Spinosaurus!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.44,0:02:22.83,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Spino...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.09,0:02:24.44,Titulo,,0,0,0,,It seems he didn't actually know at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:28.53,Titulo,,0,0,0,,It is a theropod dinosaur said to have reached up to 15 meters in length!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.94,0:02:29.87,Titulo,,0,0,0,,I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:32.29,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Please give me the next question!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:32.89,Titulo,,0,0,0,,EH?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.25,0:02:33.77,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:35.08,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Question 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.49,0:02:37.41,Titulo,,0,0,0,,What prehistoric creature's bone is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.25,0:02:40.13,Titulo,,0,0,0,,I won't make the same mistake twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:43.06,Titulo,,0,0,0,,This fin-like structure called a neural spine...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:45.44,Titulo,,0,0,0,, The creature with such bones is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:46.64,Titulo,,0,0,0,, The creature with such bones is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:50.29,Titulo,,0,0,0,,The American Bison!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.35,0:02:53.99,Titulo,,0,0,0,,We're talking about PREHISTORIC creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:57.78,Titulo,,0,0,0,,This is the neural spine from a Spinosaurus's sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.08,0:03:02.00,Titulo,,0,0,0,,However, the exact reason why it had a sail is still unknown to this day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.11,0:03:02.45,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.81,0:03:04.12,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Isn't that different from the previous picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:07.35,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Jumping Chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.39,0:03:11.06,Titulo,,0,0,0,,If you get the final question right, you become Vice President!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:11.59,Titulo,,0,0,0,,EH?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:13.27,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Well, there are no other members anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.01,0:03:16.62,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Did Spinosaurus...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.17,0:03:18.23,Titulo,,0,0,0,,walk on two legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.56,0:03:19.64,Titulo,,0,0,0,,or four legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:21.39,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Which one is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.66,0:03:24.16,Titulo,,0,0,0,,This is the last one, I can't miss it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:26.38,Titulo,,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:35.36,Titulo,,0,0,0,, IT'S FOUR LEGS!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:38.75,Titulo,,0,0,0,,BOTH ARE CORRECT!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:39.96,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Wait, that feels kinda cheap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.14,0:03:41.02,Titulo,,0,0,0,,It's not cheap at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:42.96,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Two or four legs...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.35,0:03:48.13,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Whether it walked on two or four legs is a debate still actively ongoing with every new discovery and research!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.76,0:03:49.43,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Furthermore,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:51.73,Titulo,,0,0,0,,because complete fossils are rarely found,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:57.88,Titulo,,0,0,0,,scholars have long debated whether its back had a single hump or a double hump!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:01.62,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Why is there such a debate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:03.48,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Because Spinosaurus is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:06.25,Titulo,,0,0,0,,a tragic prehistoric creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:11.06,Titulo,,0,0,0,,The museum housing its original fossils was destroyed in an airstrike,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.31,0:04:14.66,Titulo,,0,0,0,,causing the initial specimens to vanish forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:16.55,Titulo,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:19.78,Titulo,,0,0,0,,researchers never gave up despite that tragedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:22.29,Titulo,,0,0,0,,and continue to burn with passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:25.12,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Paleontology is a discipline filled
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:27.80,Titulo,,0,0,0,,with indomitable fighting spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.39,0:04:32.89,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Indomitable fighting spirit...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.11,0:04:35.80,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Welcome
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.51,0:04:38.33,Titulo,,0,0,0,,to our Paleontology Research Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.21,0:04:42.21,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Mr. President...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:45.40,Titulo,,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:46.54,Titulo,,0,0,0,,WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:48.15,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Why does it always end like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.40,0:04:50.02,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Until I can answer every question correctly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.11,0:04:52.73,Titulo,,0,0,0,,I will keep trying with an indomitable fighting spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:54.76,Titulo,,0,0,0,,Eek!
